msgid "A small, fast model is enough (for example, an 8B-class model on Ollama). When none is set, the fast model is used, then the default model. To judge an action, the tool name, command, and paths are sent to that model's provider, so a local model is recommended. If no answer comes back within 10 seconds, no model is available, or the answer can't be read, a confirmation is shown."
msgstr "小而快的模型就足够了（例如 Ollama 上的 8B 级模型）。未设置时，将使用快速模型，其次是默认模型。为了判定操作，工具名称、命令和路径会被发送到该模型的提供商，因此推荐使用本地模型。如果 10 秒内没有返回结果、没有可用模型或无法读取结果，则会显示确认。"

msgid "A token is stored. Leave this empty to keep it."
msgstr "已存储令牌。留空以保留它。"

msgid "A token needs a host and a login to sign in with."
msgstr "使用令牌需要用于登录的主机和登录名。"

msgid "A unique name used to identify this provider."
msgstr "用于标识此提供商的唯一名称。"

msgid "A wildcard is allowed only as a leading `*.` (for example, *.corp.example)."
msgstr "通配符只能作为开头的 `*.` 使用（例如 *.corp.example）。"

