msgstr "模式会与技能的 SKILL.md 文件的绝对路径进行匹配。"

msgid "Patterns are matched against the direction: `up`, `down`, `left` or `right`."
msgstr "模式与方向进行匹配：`up`、`down`、`left` 或 `right`。"

msgid "Patterns are matched against the directory path being created."
msgstr "模式会与正在创建的目录路径进行匹配。"

msgid "Patterns are matched against the element's ref, such as `e12`, or against the point as `x,y`."
msgstr "模式与元素的 ref（如 `e12`）进行匹配，或与 `x,y` 形式的位置进行匹配。"

