msgstr "模式与以 `git` 开头的完整命令（如 `git commit -m 'Fix the parser'`）进行匹配。"

msgid "Patterns are matched independently against the source path and the destination path. Enter either path below to test."
msgstr "模式会分别与源路径和目标路径进行匹配。在下方输入任一路径进行测试。"

