msgstr "此项目的定义不被允许启动。"

msgid "This project's folder is no longer open."
msgstr "此项目的文件夹已不再打开。"

msgid "This project's settings are trying to start a program as shown below. Review it before choosing."
msgstr "此项目的设置正尝试以如下方式启动程序。请在选择前检查。"

